Here is the commit message:
AMBARI-22517. NPE during Ambari schema upgrade while updating
 Hive configs.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by a NullPointerException (NPE) that occurred during the Ambari schema upgrade process when attempting to access properties of the `hsiSiteConfig` object, which could be null if the desired configuration for `HIVE_INTERACTIVE_SITE` was not found in the cluster. This lack of a null check led to the failure of the upgrade process when Hive configurations were being updated.

